al experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920780/extras/1a69696c17c251671619e0941a806159.avif?t=1773698203\" width=616 height=83 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920780/extras/258e52f00757c97a52adbaa313a6c20b.poster.avif?t=1773698203\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920780/extras/258e52f00757c97a52adbaa313a6c20b.webm?t=1773698203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920780/extras/258e52f00757c97a52adbaa313a6c20b.mp4?t=1773698203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Choice and consequence built from the DNA of RPGs - no two playthroughs are the same. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a hidden world of mythic Greek gods and monsters as you get to know a cast of hilarious, enigmatic, and compelling characters. Forget what you know about these mythological beings - in Stray Gods you’ll forge friendships and find foes with many familiar names, but not so familiar stories. Play as star and stagehand as you determine the story you want to tell through conversation and song. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920780/extras/03767bd369889fb1b4552f87aa8a0fe6.avif?t=1773698203\" width=616 height=83 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920780/extras/f57b445514a15a1db22e04bc3ce53d65.poster.avif?t=1773698203\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https:/